sentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Consonant Blends -- The <span class=\"strong\">sch</span> Sound", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Consonant clusters like /sch/ can occur at the beginning of a word in English. In these words, the /ch/ letters usually sound like /k/. <br/><br/>Practice blending the sound from one consonant sound into the next without adding a vowel sound in between.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Read the following words aloud.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"*schema\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"school\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"schooled\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"scholar\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"*schedule\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"scheme\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"scholastic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"schism\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "*The words <span class =\"italic\">schedule</span> and <span class =\"italic\">schema</span> can be pronounced in two ways, like /sk/ or  /sh/.   ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Don't get schooled about eating your vegetables! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Follow these tips and you will create your own schema of healthy eating.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Linking and Deletion with Must  ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When a word ending in consonant +/t/ links into a word beginning with a consonant, the final /t/ of the first word is often deleted. This is often the case with the word <span class =\"italic\">must</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you delete (or drop) the final /t/, the sound before the /t/ must link smoothly into the following word.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You must be starving = You mus_be starving", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When the word <span class =\"italic\">have</span> follows <span class =\"italic\">must</span>,  have is reduced to \u201c_ov\u201d or \u201c_av\u201d.<br/>The 't' sound joins the reduced <span class =\"italic\">have</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "must have   =  mus_tuv or mus_tav ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Phrase</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Pronunciation</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"must find\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mus_find\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"must be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mus_be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"must just hustle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mus_jus_hus_sul\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"must have forgotten\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mus_tuv forgotten <br/>mus_ta forgotten\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "This is the topic of many articles and conversations, so it must be (mus_be) difficult for many people.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Eating healthy must make (mus_make) a difference in how you feel.  ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to speculate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to guess something, based on what you know already", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I speculate that eating healthy must make a difference in how you feel.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob04aud01",